<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber upgrades three REITs.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber upgrades three REITs.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Jonathan Litt upgraded IRT Property Co, Reckson Associates Realty Corp and Bay Apartment Communities Inc to buy from attractive, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Cited strong fundamentals among real estate investment trusts as well as attractive stock valuations.</p>
<p>-- IRT rose 1/8 to 11-1/8, Reckson gained 5/8 to 21-7/8 and Bay Apartment added 1/8 to 33-1/4.</p>
</text>
